# A reference slot in a recorded fact body is its target's handle
# ([RFCS.6.3], [RFCS.6a.3], [RDSC.5.8.3]); fixture 135_ref_slot_body. Drives
# each runtime's fact-body writer, reader and replayer on a reference slot.
#
#   Owner 1 -> Tag n=1 owner=<Owner 1> alt=<Owner 1>   alt's field written
#   Owner 2 -> Tag n=2 owner=<Owner 2> alt=null        alt's field absent
# @spec [RFCS.6.3] [RFCS.6a.3]
assert Owner id=1
pump
assert Owner id=2
pump
